    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13219" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομιμνῄσκομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μνήσομαι,</span>
		aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εμνησάμην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>remember, recognize</i>: hence,
				<i>repay,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ οἱ ἀπεμνήσαντο [χάριν</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				24.428
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεμνήσαντο χάριν εὐεργεσιάων</span>
			<i>for</i> benefits, hes.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				503
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτῷδὲ . . χάριν ἀπομνήσεσθαι ἀξίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.137
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				299
			</span></i>.</div>
